  <description>Golden Axe is an arcade beat-'em-up game that puts players in the shoes of one of three heroes, each with his own reason for trying to overthrow the evil rule of Death-Adder, who - along with his forces of darkness - kidnapped and imprisoned the King and his daughter and stole the legendary Golden Axe.

This is a horizontal fighting game, where you basically take one of the three characters (the barbarian Ax Battler, a dwarf named Gilius Thunderhead or the amazon Tyris Flare) and bash everything which stands between you and Death Adder himself.

The game allows to play up to two players on a same screen, however in the C64 version this option has not been implemented. C64 version was also stripped off in the other areas, such as: only one enemy can engage the player at a time or there are only two types of dragons instead of three.</description>
  <comments></comments>
  <secrets>Level select
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go to the character select screen.
&lt;li&gt;Press the space bar followed by a number key on the top row of your keyboard to select the stage of your choice.
&lt;li&gt;The number you choose should be between 1 and 8. &lt;li&gt;Continue by selecting your character.
&lt;/ol&gt;


More credits
On player select screen, hold right, down diagonal, b and start together to get your choice of level.

From the same point, push right and down diagonal and a, c and start and nine credits are all yours.
</secrets>
  <genre>
