    <col>Almost all of the cheats from this game are identical with the cheats from &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?game=Doom&quot;&gt;Doom&lt;/a&gt;, except the No Clip.idbeholda  :   gives the Computer Map power-upidbeholdi  :   gives the Invisibility power-upidbeholdl  :   gives the Light Amplification Toggles power-upidbeholdr  :   gives the Toxic Suit power-upidbeholds  :   gives the Berserk power-upidbeholdv  :   gives the Invincible power-upidchoppers :   gives the chainsawidclevXX   :   jump to level XX, whereby XX is a number between 01 and 32idclip     :   no clip mode (ON/OFF); replaces the old &quot;idspispopd&quot;iddqd      :   god mode (ON/OFF)iddt       :   works only when map is active; reveals the map, after typing a second time it reveals all monstersidfa       :   gives all weapons and ammoidkfa      :   gives in addition to &quot;idfa&quot; also all keycardsidmypos    :   shows your position in the level, by using X and Y coordinates (ON/OFF)All power-ups working like found in the game, wearing off after a few seconds, except of Computer Map, which is permanent.</col>
