   <line>
    <col>a) Go to the level 'The Hotel'b) Keep making left turns in the Hedge Maze c) You will then see a rather frozen &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?developer=Jack+Nicholson&quot;&gt;Jack Nicholson&lt;/a&gt; and tons of Dynamite. d) Pressing on Nicholson will result in a scream: &quot;Here is Johnny!&quot;&lt;small&gt;Information contributed by&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mobygames.com/user/sheet/userSheetId,7471/&quot;&gt;B14ck W01f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</col>
    <col>Jack Nicholson easter egg</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>a) Go to E1L6 in the JOJO room b) Walk to the front of the snake pit and press the spacebar on the left warning sign c) Quickly, go behind the snake pit and you'll find a secret room in which &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?gamegroup=Duke+Nukem&quot;&gt;Duke Nukem&lt;/a&gt; is hanging from the ceiling.&lt;small&gt;Information contributed by&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mobygames.com/user/sheet/userSheetId,7471/&quot;&gt;B14ck W01f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</col>
    <col>Duke Nukem easter egg</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>The very first level of Blood, exit the mausoleum, turn right, and try opening the wall. There's a secret room with Eric Draven's empty grave from &lt;i&gt;The Crow&lt;/i&gt;. &lt;small&gt;Information contributed by&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mobygames.com/user/sheet/userSheetId,7471/&quot;&gt;B14ck W01f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</col>
    <col>The Crow easter egg</col>
