 >
  <description>In Terminator 2029, you play one of Col. John Connor's Special Operations Group tasked to destroy Skynet. You  wear Advanced Combat Armor that has configurable slots for weapons which can be swapped on the fly. The gameplay is first-person but you are restricted to the 4 compass directions (e.g. turning left spins you around 90 degrees).   The weapons slot feature is well used as you acquire new weapons and attachments as you progess through the game.</description>
  <comments></comments>
  <secrets>Invulnerability
C+W+F5 
for invulnerability to damage.
(CD Version only) 


Unlimited Ammo
C+W+F6 
for unlimited ammo.
(CD Version only) </secrets>
