  <description>The second part of the Sven Bomwollen series lets the player choose one of the various game settings such as a farm, a meadow or a junkyard. It is Sven's objective to please all sheep within the setting until they burst with joy. The shepherd Lars, his dog Wotan and a girl called Bromse are trying to keep Sven doing so.There are four episodes divided into 45 levels.Every level has to be cleared within a set time limit. To make things easier, Sven can collect extra items that give him special abilities for a short while, e.g. a rocket that makes him faster, a mushroom that makes him lethargic and a gift that provides him with a little extra time.</description>
