  <description>In the third part of the Sven Bomwollen series, the little black ram has been abducted by aliens who cloned him and now let both Svens loose on the unsuspecting sheep community. Now he is not the only casanova in the flock anymore. The innovation in this story twist is the resulting two-player-mode. Two players share one keyboard and compete in obtaining the highest score and pleasing the most sheep respectively.The sheep have different moods (indicated by a weather symbol above its head), ranging from sunny to storm clouds. Various items can improve the sheep's mood such as roses and rockets. There are 43 levels divided into 4 episodes. And of course, Sven's opponents like the shepherd or his dog are also in for the ride again.</description>
