  lendDate=""
  borrowings=""
  favourite="0"
  tags=""
 >
  <description>Racing at its &quot;wacky-est&quot;? Wacky Wheels is a go-kart racing game where you can play any of eight wacky animals. Each animal has its own colorful antics and animations, including a tiger, elephant, raccoon, panda, shark, and more. You can use a variety of special pick ups and power ups to use on your opponents. Featuring internet, null modem, and split screen modes to play your friends.</description>
  <comments></comments>
  <secrets>Meet the Dopefish!

To see the Dopefish in Wacky Wheels, begin a race,
pick your character (doesn't matter who), and when the race
starts, hold down the Brake button and start rotating to the left, 
making sure the lion who starts the race is on the
screen at all times (the trick won't work if he leaves the screen!).
After about 5 turns, the Dopefish pops up, burps, and leaves.
You can keep on doing this for as long as you want...just
remember about the lion!



Play hidden track in shareware version

There is a way to play a track from the registered version of Wacky 
Wheels in the shareware version, namely, the track featured in 
the ordering information. Follow these steps: 


1.start a new game and complete track 1 
2.save the game and quit to the main menu 
3.look at the ordering information 
4.go back to main menu and restore the saved game






Source: &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?company=Apogee&quot;&gt;Apogee&lt;/a&gt;'s Official Website - &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.apogee1.com&quot;&gt;http://www.apogee1.com&lt;/a&gt;


How To Make Screenshots

Hitting [F10] during game play will write the screen out to a PCX 
file. 





Source: &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?company=Apogee&quot;&gt;Apogee&lt;/a&gt;'s Official Website - &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.apogee1.com&quot;&gt;http://www.apogee1.com&lt;/a&gt;


Quick Start

Command Line Parameter:


&quot;now&quot; will start the game directly from the main menu. 





Source: &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?company=Apogee&quot;&gt;Apogee&lt;/a&gt;'s Official Website - &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.apogee1.com&quot;&gt;http://www.apogee1.com&lt;/a&gt;


Play on the hidden track (shareware version)
Start a new game at the Champion Difficulty level and on the Bronze Wheel race. If you can place in 1st place on every single track, you'll get to race on one more track, which is the one shown on the Order screen!</secrets>
  <genre>
   <line>
    <col>Action</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>Racing / Driving</col>
   </line>
  </genre>
  <code>
   <line>
    <col>The following command line parameters can be used in both the shareware and registered versions of the game:/2 Fast gameplay. /3 Really fast gameplay. /debug Create a ERR.LOG file as you play. turbo Activate the turbo key [brake]+[fire]. jump Activate the jump key [brake]+[accelerate].Additionally, you can specify &lt;i&gt;ONE&lt;/i&gt; of the following three weapon parameters:hog Get 99 hedgehogs. ice Get 99 ice cubes. fire Get 99 fireballs. Source: &lt;a href=&quot;/search/quick?company=Apogee&quot;&gt;Apogee&lt;/a&gt;'s Official Website - &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.apogee1.com&quot;&gt;http://www.apogee1.com&lt;/a&gt;</col>
    <col>Official Cheat Codes</col>
   </line>
  </code>
 </item>
