  <description>Blobby Volley is a beach volleyball game for up to two players with a unique touch.

Your opponent and you aren't persons, but blobs!

You can control your blob either with the keyboard or the mouse, moving it left or right on your side of the playfield. One of you will serve the ball and then it's your job to play the ball so that your opponent either can't hit the ball (before it makes it to the ground) or needs more then three hits to throw it back. The ball however, can bounce back from the edges of the screen.

If your opponent served the ball and you &quot;score&quot;, you just get the ball for serving. If you served the ball and scored, then you really scored a point. The player who get 15 points wins.

You can either play against the computer (three different difficulty levels) or one-on-one via Internet or LAN (TCP/IP).</description>
