  <code>
   <line>
    <col>Beat the game with Shinnok, in the versus screen select the hidden menu and press: up, up, up, left to select Shinnok and choose it with run + block.</col>
    <col>Unlock Goro</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>Win using the group mode with all characters and when you did it, choose any character and your character is Meat.</col>
    <col>Unlock Meat</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>Beat the game with Reiko, then enter the code 012 012 on the versus screen and exit to title screen. Select the hidden menu on character selection and press: up, up, left to select Reiko and choose it with Run + Block.</col>
    <col>Unlock Noob Saibot</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>To change your character wearing, hold start and press X or block button 2 times.Note: Doesn't apply to Sonya and Tanya.</col>
    <col>Change character wearing</col>
   </line>
   <line>
    <col>Enter the code 302 213 at the versus screen, when the match starts, exit to title screen and go to options menu, highlight versus screen enabled and hold down run + block at the same time for 10 seconds.</col>
    <col>Cheats menu</col>
   </line>
  </code>
 </item>
