    <col>You must have the patch installed to use thes cheats. Click on the windows Start menu, choose the Run option, and type C:\avp\avp.exe - debug (depending on where you installed  the game. Then ingame you hit the ~ to open the console and type these cheats:FREAKOFTHEUNIVERSE -- God mode for MarineSKULLCOLLECTOR -- God mode for PredatorTHEONEDEADLYCREATUREEVERCREATED -- Gode mode for AlienGIMME_CHARGE -- Replenishes Predator's energyWINNEROFTHEONEGREATBATTLEOFTHEUNIVERSE -- Turns the Alien into the final XenomorphGIVEALLWEAPONS -- All weapons and ammoOBSERVER -- InvisibleSHOWFPS -- Framerate  </col>
    <col>Cheats</col>
   </line>
  </code>
 </item>
