   <line>
    <col>Type &quot;debugon&quot; in mid game to activate the debug mode.In the debug mode you can:*Run very fast by holding Ctrl.*Jump very high and far or swim very fast by holding Space+Ctrl.*Switch between slow motion and normal motion by clicking Shift+S.*Dinosaurs will ignore you until you shoot them.*You can walk on lava without being cooked.*Show the time by clicking Ctrl+T.*You will have unlimited ammo.When you want to turn off the debug mode, just type &quot;debugon&quot; again.NOTE: If you hunt dinosaurs while debug mode is activated, you will earn less points.</col>
