   </line>
  </genre>
  <code>
   <line>
    <col>In the game manual, there is a key with no defined function (it's ALT on the PC)... In the hall of mirrors, if you go halfway into the mirror on the right side of the screen and tap S.O.S. in Morse code (three short presses, three long presses, three short presses) on the ALT key, the lives counter will be substituted by the infinity symbol (8 in the horizontal), and you'll have infinite lives. This cheat works on all platforms.</col>
    <col>Infinite lives on Weird Dreams</col>
   </line>
  </code>
 </item>
