  <description>Duck Shot is a single player 'Whac-a-Mole' variant in which the player 'shoots' ducks as they appear randomly on the screen. The developer based the game on Duck Hunt.

There are six ducks to the game, when all ducks have been shot the player is congratulated and can repeat the process. There is no timer and the game has no scoring system.
The game has four difficulty settings which control how fast the ducks move around, and a custom setting.</description>
  <comments></comments>
