  <description>Jo Guest in the Milk Round is another Interactive Girl Club game featuring a well-known British model: Joanne Guest. The game is played as a mouse-driven adventure and the plot has much in common with other IGC titles. The player, as a sudden substitute for his milkman friend, has to deliver milk in the local neighborhood. At one of the houses he is invited inside by a young woman. As the game is progressing the hostess reveals more and more about herself, until a &quot;victorious&quot; sex-scene happens.</description>
  <comments></comments>
  <secrets>Where and when to find her???
Our targeted-girl, &quot;K. Nicks&quot;, is living in Warmwell Road. She is only at home on Monday. Any amount of milk would make her happy to pay you back.

And if you want some peculiar experience, deliver milk(s) to &quot;Jo Guest&quot; (yeah, exactly her) in Cosy Thatch Rise on Saturday.</secrets>
  <genre>
   <line>
