  <description>Vosmoe Puteshestvie Sindbada: Proklyatie Karamogula (translated as The Eighth Voyage of Sindbad: Karamogul's Curse) is a colorful point-and-click adventure game. The story begins when the ship of Baghdad merchant Sindbad crashes on the shore of an unknown island. While searching for means to return home Sindbad meets island denizens, interacts with strange creatures and confronts a powerful wizard.

The game is played on static screens where the player must interact with certain objects or NPCs and occasionally solve puzzles. Items may be picked up along the way and stored in the inventory for later use. The gameplay is generally of trial and error fashion, since many screens contain deadly traps that can be easily activated by the player. The game offers two difficulty settings, with gameplay tips and item descriptions available to the player on easy setting.
</description>
