  borrower="none"
  lendDate=""
  borrowings=""
  favourite="0"
  tags=""
 >
  <description>Larry Laffer is a short, tacky, balding, forty-year-old man who has been living with his mother until recently. He used to be in the software business, but decided to leave everything behind as he moved to the city of Lost Wages in pursuit of sexual fulfillment. Clad in a white polyester leisure suit, Larry finds himself outside of Lefty's Bar, determined to finally lose his virginity - or commit suicide if he is unable to achieve that goal before dawn.

Leisure Suit Larry in the Land of the Lounge Lizards is the first game in Al Lowe's Leisure Suit Larry series, largely inspired by the text adventure Softporn Adventure, though with a greatly enhanced script containing more humorous descriptions and dialogue. The gameplay is similar to other third-person Sierra adventures: a text parser is used to input commands for interaction with a graphical environment. Progress is achieved by collecting various items and figuring out which of those may be essential for conquering the hearts of the several female characters appearing in the game.

The game allows the player to access most of its locations (a bar, a casino, a convenience store, etc.) from the very beginning, with only a few key ones being barred due to the lack of a crucial item. Moving between some of the locations can only be done by cab. Paying for those trips, as well as procuring some of the items, requires the player to manage Larry's finance by gambling at the casino. Typical of Sierra games, progress is tracked through a set amount of points, awarded for advancement or minor actions. There are several ways to die in the game, most presented in a humorous fashion. The game contains adult situations and semi-implicit depictions of sex.</description>
  <comments></comments>
  <secrets>Passing the age check verification

to bypass the simple questions in the beginning of the game, just press ALT-X.



Walkthrough
You play Larry Laffer (aka: Leisure Suit Larry) who is in the city of Lost Wages. With hardly any money, he needs to make the most of his night by looking for women to flirt with. Before starting the game, you are asked how old you are, and are asked a series of questions to prove your age. You may brave the questions yourself, or go &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mobygames.com/game/dos/leisure-suit-larry-in-the-land-of-the-lounge-lizards/hints/hintId,863&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to find out how to bypass these (DOS version only). This walkthrough also applies to the SCI version of the game, but it is assumed that you already know how to use the point-and-click interface.

You start outside Lefty's bar. Go up to the door and OPEN DOOR. Go to the doorway at the top-left of the screen. You will see a drunk and a table in this hallway. Go over to the table and GET ROSE from it. Next, TALK DRUNK and OPEN DOOR to the bathroom. Inside the bathroom, go over to the sink and LOOK INSIDE SINK. TAKE RING. See the graffiti on the left wall? LOOK GRAFFITI until you discover the password. Leave the bathroom. Return to the bar. Go over to an empty stool and SIT DOWN. The person next to you gives you some shit, but just ignore him. TALK BARTENDER to get his attention. When he comes to you, order a WHISKEY (but don't drink it). Return to the hallway and GIVE WHISKEY to the drunk to get his remote control. Now return to the bar again and KNOCK DOOR on the right. 

When asked for the passwoid, tell him the password that you found in the bathroom to be let in. Inside, USE REMOTE to turn on the television in the center of the room, and CHANGE CHANNEL until the pimp is interested in what is on. Go upstairs to the hooker's room, and TAKE CANDY from the table. OPEN WINDOW next to it, and then CLIMB OUT. Go to the left edge of the platform, and you will fall into the dumpster below. TAKE HAMMER from inside the dumpster, then CLIMB OUT. Go left and CALL TAXI. When the taxi arrives, OPEN DOOR to get it. When you are asked where you want to go, say STORE. When you arrive at your destination, PAY and GET OUT.

Go to the shelf with the magazines and TAKE MAGAZINE. Go toward the back of the store, to the wines, and TAKE WINE. Go to the storekeeper and LOOK SIGN, then ASK LUBBER. Select whatever options you want. Notice that all the security cameras point to you, and after you've made the purchase, the storekeeper yells to everyone that you did so. PAY for the items and leave the store. Wait until a bum walks by. TALK BUM and GIVE WINE. He will give you a pocket knife. Go over to the phone and LOOK PHONE. USE PHONE and dial 5556969. You are asked some questions on your lover. After you hang up, go to the right to the disco then return to the store. The phone should ring. ANSWER PHONE. After this, CALL TAXI again and get in it. Make the cabbie take you to the BAR, and PAY as soon as you get there. GET OUT.

OPEN DOOR to the bar and KNOCK DOOR then say the password again. When you get inside, go upstairs. Get over to the bed and UNDRESS. WEAR LUBBER and HAVE SEX with the hooker. When that is over, REMOVE LUBBER. (Failing to do this will result in you getting arrested.) Go to the window and CLIMB OUT. Fall into the dumpster again and CLIMB OUT. Go left, CALL TAXI, get inside, get the cabbie to take you to the CASINO HOTEL, PAY him, and GET OUT.

Enter the casino, and find a slot machine that isn't occupied, and PLAY SLOTS. Follow the instructions on screen, and play until you get $250. If you win a certain amount, save your game. Restore when you lose. Once you get $250, stop playing and go north. LOOK INSIDE ASHTRAY by the elevator and GET DISCO PASS. Leave the casino hotel and wait until a man in a barrel comes by and offers you an apple. (You may have to go to another screen then come back if he doesn't come.) BUY APPLE. CALL TAXI and get inside the cab. Go to the DISCO and PAY the cabbie. Now GET OUT.

Approach the bouncer outside the disco and SHOW DISCO PASS to be allowed in. SIT DOWN next to the girl in the empty chair, then LOOK GIRL. TALK GIRL to find out that her name is Fawn. GIVE ROSE, GIVE RING, and GIVE CANDY, then ask her to DANCE. Fawn will leave you and go on the dance area. STAND UP and follow her. Larry will automatically dance. When you are done with that, SIT DOWN with her again. LOOK GIRL and TALK GIRL. She will bring up marriage, so GIVE MONEY. When she gets up and leaves the disco, STAND UP as well and leave the disco. CALL TAXI once again, get in, and ask to be driven to the CHAPEL.

At the chapel, go toward the flasher and TALK MAN. Go to the chapel door and OPEN DOOR. Fawn is already at the chapel. Go up to her and MARRY FAWN. (Make sure that you have plenty of money. If you don't, try your luck at the casino.) Both of you agree that the two of you should meet again in the casino's honeymoon suite. Fawn will leave the chapel and head there, where she is desperately waiting for you there. Luckily for you, the casino is right next door. Leave the chapel and go left. Enter the casino and go north. Enter the elevator and PRESS FOUR. When you arrive on the 4th floor, KNOCK DOOR with the heart on it. Inside the room, TALK FAWN. She requests a little music, so go to the radio at the back of the room, and TURN ON RADIO. Shortly, you will hear an advertisement for Ajax Liquor Services. Write down their number, then leave the hotel. Take yourself to the STORE.

Go over to the phone and USE PHONE. Dial the number for Ajax. When you are asked what you want, say WINE. When you are asked where they should deliver to, say CASINO HOTEL HONEYMOON SUITE. Go back to the CASINO HOTEL and go inside. Return to the fourth floor and enter the honeymoon suite. TALK GIRL then GIVE WINE. UNDRESS. Fawn starts to have sex with you, but decides to steal everything but $10 from you. She also gets a little kinky, and ties you to the bed instead. When her little game is over, USE KNIFE to cut the rope. GET ROPE and leave the suite. Take the elevator to the first floor, and PLAY SLOTS again. Once you have $250 again, leave the casino hotel and go to the BAR.

Go inside Lefty's and KNOCK DOOR yet again, saying the password. Go upstairs and CLIMB OUT the window. Go to the right side of the railing and TIE ROPE TO RAILING. TIE ROPE TO LARRY and LEAN OUT. SMASH WINDOW and TAKE PILLS, which are called &quot;Spanish Fly&quot;. GO BACK to the railing and UNTIE ROPE. Fall down into the dumpster again, GET OUT, and go left. CALL TAXI and return to the CASINO HOTEL.

There, go inside and go north. Enter the elevator and PRESS EIGHT, which is the top floor of the casino. Now approach the woman behind the desk. LOOK WOMAN and TALK WOMAN. You find out that her name is Faith. GIVE PILLS to her. Doing this will make her horny and run off to her boyfriend. After she leaves, PUSH BUTTON and enter the elevator to arrive at the penthouse. 

Go right to the bedroom and OPEN CLOSET then enter. GET DOLL, LOOK DOLL, and INFLATE DOLL (x2). Follow the doll to the spa that has a woman in it. Her name is Eve, and she is the woman of your dreams. Approach her and TALK WOMAN. She invites you to join her, so UNDRESS. LOOK WOMAN and GIVE APPLE. Larry lives happily ever after... for now.
</secrets>
  <genre>
   <line>
    <col>Adventure</col>
   </line>
  </genre>
 </item>
 <item
  id="283"
  ean=""
  name="Colonel's Bequest"
  boxpic=""
  backpic=""
