    <col>When in a time machine, press all the buttons on the first row from left to right, and then the leftmost button on the second row. With this code put in, pressing the 'ENT' button will take you to a secret area - Planet Ortega from Space Quest 3! Exiting the time machine while on Ortega will kill you.</col>
    <col>Secret Time Machine Code</col>
   </line>
