  <description>World of Warcraft: Warlords of Draenor is the fifth expansion pack for the MMORPG World of Warcraft. The story takes place after the events of Mists of Pandaria on the orc home world Draenor before its destruction in an alternate universe.

The level cap of 90 from the previous expansion, World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria, has been raised to 100 and character models have been upgraded. Another new feature is the building and upgrading of a garrison.
